      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Stagecoach (1939) filmed here introduced John Wayne to Monument Valley, making the buttes a backdrop for classic Westerns.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.utahscanyoncountry.com/Monument-Valley-Oljato/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Navajo call it Tsé Biiʼ Ndzisgaii, meaning 'valley of the rocks,' and consider the land sacred.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
